  "body": "This reverts commit 7711a1f0912b5f10a3d3664e359a54716ddb307c. As\ndiscussed in #3995, these changes were made prematurely without\nappropriate implementer signoff. Since then, a plethora of issues around\nthe changes here have been opened up (e.g. #3994, #4023, #4030, #4033,\n#4034). We revert these changes until a more complete and agreed-upon\nspecification can replace them.\n\nCloses #3995.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4037/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 14, 2018, 6:50 PM GMT (879c5a1)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4037/6867dfa...879c5a1/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 14, 2018, 6:50 PM GMT (879c5a1)\">diff</a> )",
